{"file": "tori.trades_429_132134v_DEaKk52i_nT.mp4", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.4, "text": "The ugliest human emotion that exists, envy.", "words": [{"w": "The", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.3}, {"w": "ugliest", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.82}, {"w": "human", "start": 0.82, "end": 1.36}, {"w": "emotion", "start": 1.36, "end": 1.84}, {"w": "that", "start": 1.84, "end": 2.06}, {"w": "exists,", "start": 2.06, "end": 2.64}, {"w": "envy.", "start": 3.18, "end": 3.4}]}, {"start": 3.88, "end": 6.04, "text": "Nobody ever wants to admit that they're envious.", "words": [{"w": "Nobody", "start": 3.88, "end": 4.2}, {"w": "ever", "start": 4.2, "end": 4.5}, {"w": "wants", "start": 4.5, "end": 4.78}, {"w": "to", "start": 4.78, "end": 4.96}, {"w": "admit", "start": 4.96, "end": 5.22}, {"w": "that", "start": 5.22, "end": 5.42}, {"w": "they're", "start": 5.42, "end": 5.62}, {"w": "envious.", "start": 5.62, "end": 6.04}]}, {"start": 6.42, "end": 8.06, "text": "It's a sign that we feel inferior", "words": [{"w": "It's", "start": 6.42, "end": 6.52}, {"w": "a", "start": 6.52, "end": 6.72}, {"w": "sign", "start": 6.72, "end": 6.9}, {"w": "that", "start": 6.9, "end": 7.06}, {"w": "we", "start": 7.06, "end": 7.2}, {"w": "feel", "start": 7.2, "end": 7.44}, {"w": "inferior", "start": 7.44, "end": 8.06}]}, {"start": 8.06, "end": 9.68, "text": "and it's an ugly emotion", "words": [{"w": "and", "start": 8.06, "end": 8.5}, {"w": "it's", "start": 8.5, "end": 8.64}, {"w": "an", "start": 8.64, "end": 8.72}, {"w": "ugly", "start": 8.72, "end": 9.1}, {"w": "emotion", "start": 9.1, "end": 9.68}]}, {"start": 9.68, "end": 11.68, "text": "and it leads to kind of sabotage", "words": [{"w": "and", "start": 9.68, "end": 10.04}, {"w": "it", "start": 10.04, "end": 10.14}, {"w": "leads", "start": 10.14, "end": 10.36}, {"w": "to", "start": 10.36, "end": 10.52}, {"w": "kind", "start": 10.52, "end": 10.74}, {"w": "of", "start": 10.74, "end": 10.86}, {"w": "sabotage", "start": 10.86, "end": 11.68}]}, {"start": 11.68, "end": 13.28, "text": "and passive-aggressive behavior.", "words": [{"w": "and", "start": 11.68, "end": 11.82}, {"w": "passive", "start": 11.82, "end": 12.22}, {"w": "-aggressive", "start": 12.22, "end": 12.78}, {"w": "behavior.", "start": 12.78, "end": 13.28}]}, {"start": 13.64, "end": 15.82, "text": "Well, you can flip that envy around", "words": [{"w": "Well,", "start": 13.64, "end": 13.8}, {"w": "you", "start": 13.86, "end": 13.96}, {"w": "can", "start": 13.96, "end": 14.14}, {"w": "flip", "start": 14.14, "end": 14.54}, {"w": "that", "start": 14.54, "end": 14.96}, {"w": "envy", "start": 14.96, "end": 15.42}, {"w": "around", "start": 15.42, "end": 15.82}]}, {"start": 15.82, "end": 19.3, "text": "into something joyful and actually powerful and creative", "words": [{"w": "into", "start": 15.82, "end": 16.1}, {"w": "something", "start": 16.1, "end": 16.46}, {"w": "joyful", "start": 16.46, "end": 17.16}, {"w": "and", "start": 17.16, "end": 17.76}, {"w": "actually", "start": 17.76, "end": 18.12}, {"w": "powerful", "start": 18.12, "end": 18.56}, {"w": "and", "start": 18.56, "end": 18.9}, {"w": "creative", "start": 18.9, "end": 19.3}]}, {"start": 19.3, "end": 21.88, "text": "once you're aware that you have these tendencies.", "words": [{"w": "once", "start": 19.3, "end": 19.62}, {"w": "you're", "start": 19.62, "end": 19.92}, {"w": "aware", "start": 19.92, "end": 20.28}, {"w": "that", "start": 20.28, "end": 20.74}, {"w": "you", "start": 20.74, "end": 20.84}, {"w": "have", "start": 20.84, "end": 21.1}, {"w": "these", "start": 21.1, "end": 21.28}, {"w": "tendencies.", "start": 21.28, "end": 21.88}]}, {"start": 22.22, "end": 25.36, "text": "So you're always comparing yourself to other people", "words": [{"w": "So", "start": 22.22, "end": 22.52}, {"w": "you're", "start": 22.52, "end": 22.82}, {"w": "always", "start": 22.82, "end": 23.16}, {"w": "comparing", "start": 23.16, "end": 23.72}, {"w": "yourself", "start": 23.72, "end": 24.34}, {"w": "to", "start"